{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             \n \n \n こんにちは、こんばんは。\n \n 櫻坂46の齋藤冬優花です🐷🌸\n \n \n ブログお久しぶりになってしまいました、すみません！\n \n メッセージアプリの方では毎日元気にさせてもろてます✉️\n \n \n \n \n ー\n \n \n \n \n 本日、『アップトゥーボーイ』さんの発売日でございます！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHY4MNM02NG4R1YWTK35MMX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n アップトゥーボーイさんでソロで撮影させていただくのは初でした！ありがとうございます！！！！！🙏🏻\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHY4NNYTZ0QQ8WV7XZHPAP1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n もうマフラーの季節なのよね。🧣\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHY4PPAEYVTJ64BJX0G2YZN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n と思いきや薄着も✌︎\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHY4QTR2TK6CFBDZ5PZX3ZS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n サボテンと私。🌵\n \n \n \n この３着を着させていただきました！\n \n ３パターンの齋藤が見れるので、もしよろしければチェックしてください！\n \n 表紙は、ゆいぽん🐕、理佐🐈、ひかるちゃん🦜です！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHY4RYMD16HZMG351G83CD7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHY4T27DVSTQ1V0206S4G7N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 楽しかったー！\n \n \n \n \n またね🌝             "}],"source":"archive"}